Thank you Jan,
Glad to hear you managed to get GGIR to work.
The decimal separator of the machine is indeed something that needs looking into, we are aware of it <https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues/116>.

1. This is possible with argument qwindow (see package documentation for details).
2. Sorry not at the moment. However, it would be possible to develop this as an extra functionality where you as user specify the text that needs to be in the pdf reports. Either hire me to do it (https://www.movementdata.nl/how-to-help-sustain-ggir) or find someone else to build this.
3. You may want to read the papers by Lynne Boddy, Alex Rowlands, and/or Stuart Fairclough as well.

Best, Vincent

